.TH MX-TOOLS 1 "2026-07-20" "MX Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mx-tools \- open MX Linux configuration tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mx-tools
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mx-tools
is a graphical launcher for configuration and maintenance tools provided by MX Linux. Select a tool from the application window to open it.
.SH OPTIONS
This application has no documented command-line options. The graphical interface provides all operations.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/mx-tools
Installed license, help, and changelog documentation.
.SH AUTHOR
MX Linux contributors.
